ry\">\n      <a href=\"/reports\">Reports</a>\n      <a href=\"/impact\">Impact</a>\n      <a href=\"/investors\">Investors</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main-content\">\n    <h1>2024 impact report</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Our progress toward net-zero operations, by the numbers.</p>\n\n    <p>Carbon intensity fell for the fourth consecutive year as we brought new solar capacity online and retired two legacy gas plants.</p>\n\n    <figure>\n      <img\n        class=\"chart\"\n        src=\"assets/emissions-2020-2024.svg\"\n        alt=\"Line chart of Scope 1 and 2 emissions from 2020 to 2024, declining steadily from 4.1 million tonnes CO2e in 2020 to 2.3 million tonnes CO2e in 2024.\"\n      >\n      <figcaption>Figure 1: Scope 1 and 2 emissions, 2020–2024 (million tonnes CO2e).</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <p>The chart above shows Scope 1 and 2 emissions declining from 4.1M tonnes CO2e in 2020 to 2.3M tonnes in 2024 — a 44% reduction against a 2019 baseline.</p>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <p>&copy; Northstar Energy. <a href=\"/downloads\">Download full report (PDF)</a></p>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
